            "content": "GitHub browser now supports multi-user matchmaking\n- Select: Connect to photon0.primitive.io to connect to matchmaking server\n- When a user lands on a GitHub repository, they will be able to see and speak with other users who are on the same repository in the GitHub graph\n\nInvite-only cloud integration\n- Connect to Bitbucket, GitHub private, GitLab and see your own code and revision history\n- After completing setup on https://cloud-beta.primitive.io, select \"Switch to private repos\" and enter pin code\n\nFor requests to join the cloud beta, please email: support@primitive.io"
